{
    "title": "FOX Weather: Daily Forecasts",
    "description": "Download FOX Weather to get the updates you need. Forecast with confidence, chase the storm with live streams, and watch trending videos, all in one place. \r\n\r\nTrack the weather on your phone with:  \r\n\u2022\tForecasting. Weatherproof your plans with forecasts that are ten days or even ten months in advance. Choose between hourly, daily, and historical views for any location worldwide. Plus, toggle between Fahrenheit and Celsius for international weather. Plan ahead for fog, downpours, frost, overcast skies, clouds, hail, mist, windstorms, sleet, and whatever wet or cold weather is coming your way. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tLocation customization. Rename locations that matter to you\u2014customize with names including \u201cStephanie\u2019s house\u201d or favorite vacation spots, like \u201cSki Heaven.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u2022\tInteractive 3D Radar Tracker. Go inside the eye of the storm with our interactive mobile radar maps, including both national and local views. Zoom, tilt, or swipe to look at the storm from any angle.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tLive streaming news. Delve into every angle of the story with over 100 meteorologists and FOX professionals, radars, helicopters, and news crews around the globe. Follow the storm, hurricane, tornado, or cyclone as it drifts across local, national, and international maps. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tAlerts. Subscribe to severe weather alerts and get push notifications about extreme or dangerous conditions. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tWidgets. Get more than just a barometer read with notifications on the humidity, UV index, and reports about thunder and lightning during storm surges. Get an at-a-glance check on the weather, with colors and icons that change depending on the conditions outside.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022\tUV Index. Find out what days you need an extra layer of sunscreen. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tWind advisories. Don\u2019t let gusts blow you off your feet, with details including speed and wind strength. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tSunrise and sunset times. Use the dusk and dawn predictors for that perfect sunrise hike or romantic orange-sky sunset dinner. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tFeels-like temp. Do you need a jacket today? Choose between actual temperatures and feels-like temperatures to find out.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tAmerica\u2019s Weather Team. Meet the meteorologists who bring you the research, personality, and education that make them our top field and studio correspondents. Dive into analysis and coverage that break down even the most complicated weather patterns. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tWeather articles. Read about the top weather stories worldwide from our team of Digital Meteorologists, reporting on the biggest weather news around the clock from the FOX Forecast Center.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tCloud Cover. Don\u2019t let clouds get in your way. Get details about how hazy the day will be.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tAir Quality Data. Breathe easy with reports about how clean the air is today. \r\n\r\n\r\nANDROID TV: Witness weather events live, either from your phone or on your TV app. Find out if it\u2019s sunny, frosty, breezy, or freezing from home or on the go. If you\u2019re watching from your Android TV, you\u2019ll enjoy: \r\n\r\n\u2022\tForecasts. Forecast seven hours or even seven days in advance. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tTrending videos. Watch the most popular videos, with news for the weather that matters. \r\n\r\nWeather apps can be a whirlwind. Get the FOX Weather App for 24/7 forecasts, news, and storm watches. FOX Weather\u2014weathering it together.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download FOX Weather to get the updates you need. Forecast with confidence, chase the storm with live streams, and watch trending videos, all in one place. <br><br>Track the weather on your phone with:  <br>\u2022\tForecasting. Weatherproof your plans with forecasts that are ten days or even ten months in advance. Choose between hourly, daily, and historical views for any location worldwide. Plus, toggle between Fahrenheit and Celsius for international weather. Plan ahead for fog, downpours, frost, overcast skies, clouds, hail, mist, windstorms, sleet, and whatever wet or cold weather is coming your way. <br><br>\u2022\tLocation customization. Rename locations that matter to you\u2014customize with names including \u201cStephanie\u2019s house\u201d or favorite vacation spots, like \u201cSki Heaven.\u201d<br><br>\u2022\tInteractive 3D Radar Tracker. Go inside the eye of the storm with our interactive mobile radar maps, including both national and local views. Zoom, tilt, or swipe to look at the storm from any angle.<br><br>\u2022\tLive streaming news. Delve into every angle of the story with over 100 meteorologists and FOX professionals, radars, helicopters, and news crews around the globe. Follow the storm, hurricane, tornado, or cyclone as it drifts across local, national, and international maps. <br><br>\u2022\tAlerts. Subscribe to severe weather alerts and get push notifications about extreme or dangerous conditions. <br><br>\u2022\tWidgets. Get more than just a barometer read with notifications on the humidity, UV index, and reports about thunder and lightning during storm surges. Get an at-a-glance check on the weather, with colors and icons that change depending on the conditions outside.<br><br><br>\u2022\tUV Index. Find out what days you need an extra layer of sunscreen. <br><br>\u2022\tWind advisories. Don\u2019t let gusts blow you off your feet, with details including speed and wind strength. <br><br>\u2022\tSunrise and sunset times. Use the dusk and dawn predictors for that perfect sunrise hike or romantic orange-sky sunset dinner. <br><br>\u2022\tFeels-like temp. Do you need a jacket today? Choose between actual temperatures and feels-like temperatures to find out.<br><br>\u2022\tAmerica\u2019s Weather Team. Meet the meteorologists who bring you the research, personality, and education that make them our top field and studio correspondents. Dive into analysis and coverage that break down even the most complicated weather patterns. <br><br>\u2022\tWeather articles. Read about the top weather stories worldwide from our team of Digital Meteorologists, reporting on the biggest weather news around the clock from the FOX Forecast Center.<br><br>\u2022\tCloud Cover. Don\u2019t let clouds get in your way. Get details about how hazy the day will be.<br><br>\u2022\tAir Quality Data. Breathe easy with reports about how clean the air is today. <br><br><br>ANDROID TV: Witness weather events live, either from your phone or on your TV app. Find out if it\u2019s sunny, frosty, breezy, or freezing from home or on the go. If you\u2019re watching from your Android TV, you\u2019ll enjoy: <br><br>\u2022\tForecasts. Forecast seven hours or even seven days in advance. <br><br>\u2022\tTrending videos. Watch the most popular videos, with news for the weather that matters. <br><br>Weather apps can be a whirlwind. Get the FOX Weather App for 24/7 forecasts, news, and storm watches. FOX Weather\u2014weathering it together.",
